      "widgets_values": [
        "Extract only the exact hairstyle from the reference photo and display it on a blank white wig display mannequin head and short neck bust.\nPreserve the original haircut silhouette, bangs, parting, length, layers, volume, individual hair strands and hair color exactly. Keep the entire visible hairstyle in frame.\nReplace all visible human face, ears, neck and shoulders with opaque solid matte white plastic. The mannequin face is a completely featureless smooth egg-shaped oval: no eyes, no eyelids, no eyebrows, no nose, no nostrils, no mouth, no lips, no facial grooves or sculpted facial features. It is a blank white display form, not a blurred or skin-colored human face. No skin texture or human skin color.\nRemove clothing, jewelry and hair accessories. Show just the original hair on the plain white mannequin head and neck bust. Clean minimal light studio background, realistic detailed hair, sharp focus."
      ],
      "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Prompt) - 原始提取发型提示词"
